OL,3,GNEWSAClean-up at dog charity after
OL,4,A'terrifying' flood
OL,5,
OL,6,FA clean-up is under way at a dog rescue
OL,7,Fcharity in north Staffordshire after
OL,8,Fits kennels flooded during Storm
OL,9,FAusten.
OL,11,FGreyhound Gap, near Kidsgrove, cares
OL,12,Ffor nearly 50 dogs, but 15 had to be
OL,13,Fevacuated and moved to other kennels on
OL,14,FFriday.
OL,16,FStorm Austen was the first named storm
OL,17,Fof the season, leaving thousands of
OL,18,Fhomes without power, downing trees and
OL,19,Fdisrupting travel across parts of
OL,20,FEngland and Wales.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,359,350,200,160,0,100
