OL,3,GNEWSAClean-up at dog charity after
OL,4,A'terrifying' flood
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It was just like a deluge came off the
OL,7,Ffield behind us - it was mud and
OL,8,Fwater," said Sarah Partridge, assistant
OL,9,Fmanager.
